{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"444","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. DZY Loves Colors"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"DZY loves colors, and he enjoys painting."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On a colorful day, DZY gets a colorful ribbon, which consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" units (they are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from left to right). The color of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th unit of the ribbon is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" at first. It is colorful enough, but we still consider that the colorfulness of each unit is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" at first."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"DZY loves painting, we know. He takes up a paintbrush with color "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and uses it to draw a line on the ribbon. In such a case some contiguous units are painted. Imagine that the color of unit "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" currently is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":". When it is painted by this paintbrush, the color of the unit becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the colorfulness of the unit increases by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|x - y|"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"DZY wants to perform "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" operations, each operation can be one of the following:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Paint all the units with numbers between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" (both inclusive) with color "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Ask the sum of colorfulness of the units between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" (both inclusive). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Can you help DZY?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n, m (1 ≤ n, m ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines begins with a integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"type (1 ≤ type ≤ 2)"},{"kind":"text","text":", which represents the type of this operation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"type = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", there will be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" more integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l, r, x (1 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ n; 1 ≤ x ≤ 108)"},{"kind":"text",